# Outfit camera (R18): a small camera drone clipped to the chest harness: ink body, four steel arms out to accent
# rotor rings, a gimbal camera under the nose with a glowing lens, and a signal-yellow ready light (a thing the
# player uses). Friendly, so rounded.
name outfit_dronecam
grid 5
size 9 9 4
slot body Ink
slot arm Steel
slot rotor SwatchAccent
slot lens SwatchGlow
slot ready Signal
beam 1.5 1.5 2.5 7.5 7.5 2.5 0.6 arm
beam 1.5 7.5 2.5 7.5 1.5 2.5 0.6 arm
ellipsoid 4.5 4.5 2 2.2 2 1.6 body
cyl 1.5 1.5 3 4 1.5 rotor
cyl 7.5 1.5 3 4 1.5 rotor
cyl 1.5 7.5 3 4 1.5 rotor
cyl 7.5 7.5 3 4 1.5 rotor
carve cyl 1.5 1.5 3 4 0.6
carve cyl 7.5 1.5 3 4 0.6
carve cyl 1.5 7.5 3 4 0.6
carve cyl 7.5 7.5 3 4 0.6
box 6 3 0 8 6 2 arm
box 8 4 0 9 5 1 lens
box 3 4 3 4 5 4 ready
pivot 2 4 0
